It&#x2019;s a reminder of our freedom, our rights, and our responsibility to protect them. &#x1F1E7;&#x1F1E9;

As we celebrate our nation&#x2019;s strength and sacrifice, let&#x2019;s also remember&#x2014;
true freedom means feeling safe, speaking freely, and looking out for one another.

A safer community starts with awareness, respect, and responsibility.

Let&#x2019;s celebrate independence with pride&#x2014;and with care.

&#x1F449; Stay aware. Stay safe.
Happy Independence Day from Self Protect.

