Ramadan is a time of reflection, patience, and kindness.

As we focus on prayer and self-discipline, let&#x2019;s also remember to take care of ourselves and the people around us.

Late-night prayers, early morning sehri, busy markets, and travel mean we should stay a little more alert during this month.
Small awareness can prevent big problems.

Look out for your family. Stay connected. Stay safe.

